noderings:index/dnsRecord:DnsRecord.description:
All records of one name and type in a zone (an RRset). Use one resource per name and type, with every value in <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`records`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Records`" pulumi-lang-go="`records`" pulumi-lang-python="`records`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`records`" pulumi-lang-java="`records`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`records`">`records`</span>.

