noderings:index/gameServer:GameServer.description:
A game server ordered from a game-server plan. Creating it places an order that is billed according to the plan; Pulumi waits until the game is installed. Destroying a fixed-price server forfeits the rest of the paid period.

## Example Usage

<!--Start PulumiCodeChooser -->
```typescript
import * as pulumi from "@pulumi/pulumi";
import * as noderings from "@noderings/pulumi";

const config = new pulumi.Config();
const planId = config.require("planId");
const paper = noderings.getGameServerGames({
    planId: planId,
    name: "Minecraft · Paper",
});
const survival = new noderings.GameServer("survival", {
    name: "survival",
    planId: planId,
    templateId: paper.then(paper => paper.id),
    acceptEula: true,
    environment: {
        MINECRAFT_VERSION: "1.21.4",
        MAX_PLAYERS: "30",
    },
    powerState: "running",
    deletionProtection: true,
}, {
    customTimeouts: {
        create: "45m",
    },
});
export const address = pulumi.interpolate`${survival.primaryIp}:${survival.primaryPort}`;
```
