noderings:index/gameServerSchedule:GameS.description:
A schedule that runs tasks on a game server at set times, for example a nightly restart or backup. Tasks run in the order they are written. Changing the server's game deletes all its schedules; Pulumi then creates this one again. The game server must be ready.

